module experiment.realtime_auction_arena.win32_auctioneer.controls
purpose module experiment.realtime_auction_arena.win32_auctioneer.controls "Control identity, labels, and layout constants for the native auctioneer operator console."
moduleOwns experiment.realtime_auction_arena.win32_auctioneer.controls "Stable GUI text, control-id constants, list labels, and default window sizing for the Win32 auctioneer scaffold."
moduleDoesNotOwn experiment.realtime_auction_arena.win32_auctioneer.controls "Native control creation, runtime handle storage, server route behavior, or auction state transitions."
invariant module experiment.realtime_auction_arena.win32_auctioneer.controls "All visible labels are centralized so main.sem can compose the current standard.gui surface without scattering operator-console copy."

type AuctioneerControlId UInt32

enum AuctioneerPanelKind repr Int32
enumCase AuctioneerPanelKind loginAuctioneerPanelKind 1
enumCase AuctioneerPanelKind itemConfigAuctioneerPanelKind 2
enumCase AuctioneerPanelKind commandAuctioneerPanelKind 3
enumCase AuctioneerPanelKind statusAuctioneerPanelKind 4
enumCase AuctioneerPanelKind eventFeedAuctioneerPanelKind 5
enumCase AuctioneerPanelKind rejectedBidAuctioneerPanelKind 6
enumCase AuctioneerPanelKind chatModerationAuctioneerPanelKind 7

